[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（２８３プロダクションに入社して数か月……\r\nいよいよ俺が、アイドルをプロデュースする時が来た）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ずっと憧れていた仕事をようやく任されたんだ、\r\nこれから精一杯頑張るぞ！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはようございます！\r\nって、天井社長……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010010,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "おはよう、お前を待っていたぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（この２８３プロダクションを束ねる\r\n天井社長……あいかわらずダンディな雰囲気だ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010020,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "お前には今日から、アイドルを\r\nプロデュースしてもらうと伝えていたが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010030,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "素晴らしい結果を期待させてもらう\r\n私は甘くないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010040,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "よろしい。では、仕事の説明ははづきに任せて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "？　はづきさんはどこにも……あっ！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そ、ソファの裏で誰かが倒れてる！？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "……ふわぁ～？\r\nなんですか～急に大きな声出して～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010050,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "は、はづき……なぜ床で寝ているんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "すみません、ソファへ着く前に\r\n眠気に負けてしまいまして～……",
    "charAnim1": "sleep2",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010060,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "せっかくまじめな雰囲気を出したというのに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010070,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……ともかく！\r\n彼に仕事の説明をしてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです\r\nプロデューサーさん、どうぞ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\n……あいかわらず、わかりやすくまとまってますね、資料",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（はづきさん、こういうところは頼れるんだよな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nそれじゃあ、さっそくお仕事の説明に入りますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "まず、今回のプロデュースの目標についてですが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ワンダーアイドルノヴァ・グランプリ……\r\n通称『W.I.N.G.』への出場を目指してください",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』……ですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "はい\r\n新人アイドルの祭典とも言われる、すごいライブなんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "祭典と言われるだけあって、この『W.I.N.G.』は\r\n出場資格を手に入れるまでが厳しいんです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "エントリーしたアイドルは開催前まで、\r\n全４回のシーズンごとに審査を受けます",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010100,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "その時、一定のランクに達していないと、\r\n出場資格を失ってしまうんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010110,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ですので、精一杯頑張っていきましょ～！\r\n私もたくさんサポートさせていただきますね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010080,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "……少しアドバイスをしておくが、\r\nお前は、２８３プロダクションのプロデューサーだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010090,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "担当アイドルと他のアイドルたちを\r\n交流させることも重要になってくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010100,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "互いに影響しあうことで目指せる高みもあるだろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1902001010110,
    "speaker": "社長",
    "text": "まあ、まずは思うようにやってみるといい\r\n結果がついてくるかは、お前とアイドルの頑張り次第だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "004",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1902001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1901001010120,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "では、そろそろお仕事に移ってもらいましょうか\r\n今回プロデュースするアイドルは──",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1901001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bg": "00029",
    "bgm": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（スカウトで見つけてきてくれって言われたけど……\r\n今日はいい子には出会えなかったな……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "013"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（もう遅いし、そろそろ引き上げて──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010010,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　かなりパンキッシュな格好をしてるなあの子\r\n……独特の雰囲気があるし、綺麗だし……）",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（──声、かけるしかない！）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっといいですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010020,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……何か用ですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、芸能事務所でプロデューサーをしているもので……\r\nあ、こちら名刺です。よければ受け取ってください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実は、君をスカウトしたくて声をかけました\r\nうちの事務所で、アイドルになってみませんか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010030,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "２８３プロダクション……\r\nなんか、唐突すぎませんー？　本気で誘ってるんですかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひと目見て、\r\n素質があると思ったんです──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺と一緒にトップアイドルを目指してみませんか？\r\n新しい世界が見られると思うんです！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010040,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……えー、でもアイドルってー、\r\n学校終わりとかに毎日練習するんですよねー？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010050,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "それはちょっとめんどくさそーじゃないですかぁ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっと……、君、学生なのか？\r\n大学生？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010060,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "いえー、違いますー",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え！？　じゃあ……\r\n高校生？",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010070,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "そうですケドー？ \r\n見えませんかぁ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見えない……って、それはどうでもいい。\r\nこんな時間にひとりで、危ないじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010080,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "別にいつもこうですケド……\r\nてか、スカウトのお兄さんの方がめちゃめちゃ怪しいですし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010090,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "まぁいいや、話は終わりでいいですかぁ？\r\n私、もう行きますねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、ちょっと待って！",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010100,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……まだ、何か用があるんですかぁ？\r\nアイドル、やりませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "005",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうじゃない\r\nこんな時間に君ひとり放っておけないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010110,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "…………\r\n……お兄さん、変わってますねー",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "普通は心配するよ\r\n危険な目にあってからじゃ遅いんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010120,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "……初めて会った相手に、こんなしつこく叱る人、\r\nフツーとは言いませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1005001010130,
    "speaker": "？？？",
    "text": "まぁ、そんなに言うなら、お兄さんに免じて\r\n今日は帰ってあげますねー。それではぁ、さよーならぁ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100500101/1005001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……駅の方向へ向かって行ったな\r\nちゃんと帰宅してくれるといいんだが……）",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "x": 200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 450
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
